Changes:
 ros-jazzy-legged-model (3.5.0-2026.08.25.10.38) noble; urgency=high
 .
   * Take the joint name by reference in getJointIndex
     It took std::string by value, and the G1 joint names are past the small
     string optimisation, so the position_delta action path allocated and
     freed once per joint per control cycle.
